    <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#9C8B7B;margin-top:1.5rem">Train Station sits in Chapter 1 of Rooms &amp; Exits and is roughly a four and a half minute room once you know the order. If you are playing a build released after this recording, the numbers on the departures board are the most likely thing to have been reshuffled. The structure of the puzzle, three rows in and three rows out, has been stable across every version we have checked.</p>

